id: full-wager
name: Full Wager
kind: signature
side: advantages
tpCost: 10
requirement: N/A
description: >
  You are able to unleash all of your energy in this single attack!
text: >
  For this Attacking Maneuver, the amount of Ki Points you can Ki Wager is only
  limited by your remaining Capacity.

---

# No script. What this changes is the ceiling on a number a dialog asks for, and a
# script changes values on a character rather than the questions put to them - so
# the Ki Wager's own ceiling reads this Advantage by name, where that ceiling lives.
#
# What it comes to: the usual limit is the lower of half your Max Capacity, your
# remaining Capacity, and the Ki you actually hold. This lifts the first of those
# three and leaves the other two, because "only limited by your remaining Capacity"
# still cannot let you spend Ki you do not have.
